 "name_en": "Solution Quotation Management with SAP CPQ (7HB)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Solution Quotation Management with SAP CPQ (7HB)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables seamless data integration between <span class=\"ph emphasis\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud, Private Edition</span> and <span class=\"ph emphasis\">SAP CPQ</span>. You can create customer and product master data in <span class=\"ph emphasis\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud, Private Edition </span>(including pricing) and use this data in <span class=\"ph emphasis\">SAP CPQ</span> to create a quote for physical products and service contract products. After the customer accepts the quote, you can send the quote to <span class=\"ph emphasis\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud, Private Edition</span>. A Solution Quotation is created to capture the quote from <span class=\"ph emphasis\">SAP CPQ</span> and follow-up documents such as a Sales Order and Service Contract are automatically triggered from the Solution Quote.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__ul_smg_kwr_bcc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create Solution Quote in SAP CPQ</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Place Order in SAP CPQ</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Review Solution Quotation in SAP S/4HANA Cloud, Private Edition and follow-up documents</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__ul_txv_swr_bcc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate with business partner and product</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate with pricing and product configuration via SAP Variant Configuration and Pricing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate with Solution Quotation seamlessly</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__non_standard\">\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__non_standard_reason\">\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用 SAP CPQ 的解决方案报价管理 (7HB)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持 <span class=\"ph emphasis\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud（专用版）</span>和 <span class=\"ph emphasis\">SAP CPQ</span> 之间的无缝数据集成。您可以在 <span class=\"ph emphasis\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>（包括定价）中创建客户和产品主数据，并在 <span class=\"ph emphasis\">SAP CPQ</span> 中使用此数据创建实物产品和服务合同产品的报价。客户接受报价后，您可以将报价发送到 <span class=\"ph emphasis\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>。创建解决方案报价以从 <span class=\"ph emphasis\">SAP CPQ</span> 获取报价，并从解决方案报价自动触发销售订单和服务合同等后续凭证。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__ul_smg_kwr_bcc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP CPQ 中创建解决方案报价</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP CPQ 中下达订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition 中查看解决方案报价和后续凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__ul_txv_swr_bcc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">与业务伙伴和产品集成</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过 SAP Variant Configuration and Pricing 与定价和产品配置集成</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">与解决方案报价无缝集成</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__non_standard\">\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio63395f7a19db41c49a31f06281cf0ebd__non_standard_reason\">\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
